WEBVTT

00:00:00.545 --> 00:00:06.176
Create an exam

00:00:06.226 --> 00:00:09.355
Open Academics, then Exams.

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.076
Press Create Exam.

00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:19.591
Choose the academic year, term and exam type.

00:00:30.849 --> 00:00:35.018
Enter the dates, then press Next to choose the classes.

00:00:37.752 --> 00:00:42.355
Select the class, then continue through the date sheet to the preview.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.364
Check the preview, then press Create Exam.

00:00:52.362 --> 00:00:59.035
A new exam starts as Scheduled. You move it forward as marks are entered and results are published.

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:06.439
Your exam is ready
